mino-tavern
===========

Fork of dsh-sillytavern (https://github.com/KamishiroRei/dsh-sillytavern),
MIT License (declared in upstream package.json).

SillyTavern-compatible preset engine: V1/V2/PNG character cards,
worldbooks, preset macros, regex rules, MVU variables. Ships as an
opt-in agent preset; does not inject globally.
